{"story":{"id":"story-d99adc5166da6db7","title":{"zh":"遭遇掠夺者","en":"Pirates Encountered"},"category":"society","image":"art/3745f25faed16562b16c.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.65","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"尽管我们仍然无法与他们建立联络，主要是因为他们并不想理我们，但我们已经可以确认[This.ContactCountry.GetName]是海盗。视觉指示器表明他们的文化很大程度上是生长于太空的，我们观察到的一些表现形式不符合任何一种居住于行星的文明。\n\n不幸的是，他们的船员似乎对民事交流没有任何兴趣。我们从截获的舰见通讯也表明他们主要以海盗活动为生，偶尔也会招募部分文明边缘的元素到他们的贼船上。","en":"Although we have been unable to establish communications with them - mainly because they are unwilling to communicate with us - we have been able to identify the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] as pirates. Visual indicators point to their culture being largely s"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact_critters.65"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.65","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.65","title":{"zh":"遭遇掠夺者","en":"Pirates Encountered"},"texts":[{"zh":"尽管我们仍然无法与他们建立联络，主要是因为他们并不想理我们，但我们已经可以确认[This.ContactCountry.GetName]是海盗。视觉指示器表明他们的文化很大程度上是生长于太空的，我们观察到的一些表现形式不符合任何一种居住于行星的文明。\n\n不幸的是，他们的船员似乎对民事交流没有任何兴趣。我们从截获的舰见通讯也表明他们主要以海盗活动为生，偶尔也会招募部分文明边缘的元素到他们的贼船上。","en":"Although we have been unable to establish communications with them - mainly because they are unwilling to communicate with us - we have been able to identify the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] as pirates. Visual indicators point to their culture being largely spaceborne, and some phenotypes observed among them match no known planet-dwelling civilizations.\n\nUnfortunately, their crews are completely uninterested in civil discourse. What little we have been able to glean from intercepting intra-fleet communications indicate that they primarily subsist on piracy, occasionally recruiting fringe elements of spacefaring civilizations to their cause."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/3745f25faed16562b16c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"真是可悲。","en":"Deplorab